{"id":"en_no-mercy-for-the-cheaters","title":"No Mercy for the Cheaters","titleEn":"No Mercy for the Cheaters","description":"Shi Lan, heiress to Canglan Group, had handed over both her company and her wealth to her husband, Meng Cheng'an. The truth began to surface when she noticed that the designer bag he gave her was a counterfeit, while his mistress, Yun Rou, carried the genuine one. Her suspicions hardened into certainty at the hospital, where she came upon the two of them together with the child they had outside their marriage. Faced with a betrayal that touched every part of her life, Shi Lan strikes back: she brings the affair into the open and takes back everything that had been taken from her.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/no-mercy-for-the-cheaters/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/no-mercy-for-the-cheaters/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Hidden Identity","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv8em/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_no-mercy-for-the-cheaters_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv8em/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_no-mercy-for-the-cheaters_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv8em/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_no-mercy-for-the-cheaters_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv8em/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_no-mercy-for-the-cheaters_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-